Farmer: You can work on any of the nine fields first. Pick whichever is closest to you.
Farmer: Each field has nine soil spots, but you only need the Kapampangan numbers we learned: apat, lima, and anam.
Farmer: Press E to plant, R to remove your last new seedling, and F to check. A wrong answer just says Wrong.
Farmer: Finish all nine fields, then come back to me.
[end_timeline]
